{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art Together is a multiplayer drawing game where creativity meets chaos. Gather people online and experience the hilarious results of collaborative art creation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your drawings evolve (or devolve) as they pass from player to player, creating amusing misinterpretations and unexpected results.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No artistic skills required! Even with zero drawing ability, your effort and enthusiasm will lead to fantastic results.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable lobby settings to tailor the experience to your preferences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, intuitive controls that anyone can pick up within seconds.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your favorite creations - preserve the most hilarious moments for posterity!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're already skilled with a pencil or completely new to drawing, Art Together offers a fun way to practice your skills. Who knows? This game might even spark your passion for the visual arts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your mouse or drawing tablet and prepare for an art experience where the journey is far more important than the destination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Noticed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3630930/72c2d123f81fecd58a229e7a4d86fb6c915c83cc.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630930?t=1752597575","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630930?t=1752597575","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630930/e8eb7ea48679b17f89f159662010976272a219f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752597575","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630930/e8eb7ea48679b17f89f159662010976272a219f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752597575","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art Together is a multiplayer drawing game where creativity meets chaos. Gather people online and experience the hilarious results of collaborative art creation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your drawings evolve (or devolve) as they pass from player to player, creating amusing misinterpretations and unexpected results.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No artistic skills required! Even with zero drawing ability, your effort and enthusiasm will lead to fantastic results.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable lobby settings to tailor the experience to your preferences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, intuitive controls that anyone can pick up within seconds.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your favorite creations - preserve the most hilarious moments for posterity!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're already skilled with a pencil or completely new to drawing, Art Together offers a fun way to practice your skills. Who knows? This game might even spark your passion for the visual arts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your mouse or drawing tablet and prepare for an art experience where the journey is far more important than the destination!</p><p